[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=2 format=3]

; A gas giant: bark and bronze bands with gold_hi where the cloud tops catch the light. blobbiness near zero is what turns continents into latitude bands, and it has no caps because it has no surface to freeze.
;
; Every colour is a data/palette.json entry, named in the comment above and
; converted here only because a .tres stores floats (CLAUDE.md 3.1).

